===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ǵneh₃-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|can}}, first and third person singular of {{m|enm|connen}}, {{m|enm|cunnen||to be able, know how}}, from {{inh|en|ang|cann|can(n)}}, first and third person singular of {{m|ang|cunnan||to know how}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*kunnan}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*kunnaną}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*ǵneh₃-}} (whence also {{m|en|know}}). {{doublet|en|con}}. See also: {{m|en|canny}}, {{m|en|cunning}}.

